{"id":"c994a65ad9a02350","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-qma.md","title":"Quantum Merlin-Arthur","display":"df-qma — Quantum Merlin-Arthur","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-qma","aliases":["28-df-qma","QMA","Quantum Merlin-Arthur"],"display":"df-qma — Quantum Merlin-Arthur","depends_on":["[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]","[[28-df-quantum-state]]","[[28-df-measurement]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.7.1; explicit verifier formalization","source_printed_pages":"231","source_pdf_pages":"257","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-qma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-qma</span><span>QMA</span><span>Quantum Merlin-Arthur</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-qma — Quantum Merlin-Arthur"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4588e429e73283a\" href=\"?note=b4588e429e73283a\" title=\"28-df-quantum-circuit\">28-df-quantum-circuit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f1a82cfa5790c35\" href=\"?note=5f1a82cfa5790c35\" title=\"28-df-measurement\">28-df-measurement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §10.7.1; explicit verifier formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"231"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"257"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\">\\(\\mathbf{QCirc}_m\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QU}\">\\(\\operatorname{QU}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Out}\">\\(\\operatorname{Out}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{size}\">\\(\\operatorname{size}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4588e429e73283a\" href=\"?note=b4588e429e73283a\" title=\"28-df-quantum-circuit\">28-df-quantum-circuit</a>；密度算子与接受投影见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b69949a89b41b967\" href=\"?note=b69949a89b41b967\" title=\"28-df-quantum-state\">28-df-quantum-state</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5f1a82cfa5790c35\" href=\"?note=5f1a82cfa5790c35\" title=\"28-df-measurement\">28-df-measurement</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\">\\(w,a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\)</span> 分别控制证据、辅助比特和门数；总线路数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)=n+w(n)+a(n)\\ge1\">\\(m(n)=n+w(n)+a(n)\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)\">\\(m(n)\\)</span> 在每组量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,a\">\\(w,a\\)</span> 下缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+w(n)+a(n)\">\\(n+w(n)+a(n)\\)</span>；输入态和接受概率只对当前族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V=(V_n)_n\">\\(\\mathcal V=(V_n)_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{x,\\sigma,a}\\coloneqq|x\\rangle\\langle x|\\otimes\\sigma\\otimes|0^{a(|x|)}\\rangle\\langle0^{a(|x|)}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m(|x|)}\\operatorname{Out}_{V_{|x|}}(\\rho_{x,\\sigma,a})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{x,\\sigma,a}\\coloneqq|x\\rangle\\langle x|\\otimes\\sigma\\otimes|0^{a(|x|)}\\rangle\\langle0^{a(|x|)}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m(|x|)}\\operatorname{Out}_{V_{|x|}}(\\rho_{x,\\sigma,a})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{QMA}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists w,a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ \\exists\\mathcal V=(V_n)_n\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (m(n)\\ge1\\land V_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{m(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(V_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{QMA}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists w,a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ \\exists\\mathcal V=(V_n)_n\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (m(n)\\ge1\\land V_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{m(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(V_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定语言版本，否实例对所有多项式比特量子证据成立。书 §10.7.1 介绍 QMA 的概念；本条将其展开为密度算子和电路量词，未把书中仅作介绍的段落当作完整形式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：§10.7.1; explicit verifier formalization，印刷页 231；PDF 页 257。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-quantum-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-quantum-state]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-measurement","status":"resolved","id":"5f1a82cfa5790c35","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-measurement]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"b4588e429e73283a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；密度算子与接受投影见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-quantum-state","status":"resolved","id":"b69949a89b41b967","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；密度算子与接受投影见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-measurement","status":"resolved","id":"5f1a82cfa5790c35","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{QCirc}_m$、$\\operatorname{QU}$、$\\operatorname{Out}$、$\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-quantum-circuit]]；密度算子与接受投影见 [[28-df-quantum-state]]、[[28-df-measurement]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{QCirc}_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{QU}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Out}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{size}","display":false},{"tex":"w,a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]","display":false},{"tex":"m(n)=n+w(n)+a(n)\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"m(n)","display":false},{"tex":"w,a","display":false},{"tex":"n+w(n)+a(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V=(V_n)_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{x,\\sigma,a}\\coloneqq|x\\rangle\\langle x|\\otimes\\sigma\\otimes|0^{a(|x|)}\\rangle\\langle0^{a(|x|)}|,\\qquad \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Tr}(E_{\\mathsf{acc},m(|x|)}\\operatorname{Out}_{V_{|x|}}(\\rho_{x,\\sigma,a})).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{QMA}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists w,a,p\\in\\mathbb N[n]\\ \\exists\\mathcal V=(V_n)_n\\ [&\\operatorname{QU}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (m(n)\\ge1\\land V_n\\in\\mathbf{QCirc}_{m(n)}\\land\\operatorname{size}(V_n)\\le p(n))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in L\\ \\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\ge2/3\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L\\ \\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathbf D(\\mathcal H_{w(|x|)})\\ \\operatorname{Acc}_{\\mathcal V,a}(x,\\sigma)\\le1/3]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2358,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-171","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"复杂性类：[[28-df-bqp]]、[[28-df-qma]]、[[28-thm-bqp-contained-pspace]]。"}],"outgoing":["b4588e429e73283a","b69949a89b41b967","5f1a82cfa5790c35"]}